OL,3,GNEWSAAll eyes on weather as reservoirs
OL,4,Astill half empty
OL,5,
OL,6,FHuge areas of England remain under
OL,7,Fwater restrictions after a hot, dry
OL,8,Fsummer.
OL,10,FYorkshire is one of the few areas to
OL,11,Fhave escaped a hosepipe ban - so far.
OL,13,FReservoirs here were full as we headed
OL,14,Finto the important spring and summer
OL,15,Fseasons following a wet winter - which
OL,16,Fappears to have been Yorkshire's saving
OL,17,Fgrace.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
