OL,3,GNEWSAAll eyes on weather as reservoirs
OL,4,Astill half empty
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut spring and summer have been dry
OL,7,Fand, significantly, September has also
OL,8,Fbeen drier than average, which has
OL,9,Fresulted in reservoirs being less than
OL,10,Fhalf full, well below where they should
OL,11,Fbe for this time of year.
